# Copy to .env on the box and fill in. NEVER commit .env.
#
# Cloudflare -> My Profile -> API Tokens -> Create Token -> Custom token
#   Permissions   : Zone / DNS / Edit
#   Zone Resources: Include / Specific zone / datakiin.com
#
# Scope it exactly that tightly. This token can rewrite DNS for the whole
# zone if over-permissioned -- it is a more dangerous credential than the
# tunnel token, because DNS control is domain control.
CF_API_TOKEN=
